    {
      "name": "Generate Links",
      "description": "Single-document signing links via `/api/v1/documents/generate-links`. Use `routing_type` (sequential / parallel) and `delivery_mode` (email / public_link / public_recipients).\n\nNOTE: This endpoint does NOT support routing_type=`mixed`; use the Packages \u2192 Send (Mixed) request when you need waves.",
