    {
      "name": "Void",
      "description": "Phase 81.67 \u2014 Cascade-void endpoints. Both endpoints are idempotent: re-voiding an already-voided entity returns the existing void info with `already_voided=true`.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Void Document",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-API-Key",
                "value": "{{x_api_key}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"reason\": \"Sent to wrong recipient \\u2014 please disregard.\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/docflow/public/documents/{{document_id}}/void",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "docflow",
                "public",
                "documents",
                "{{document_id}}",
                "void"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Void a document. Cascades to all non-terminal recipients (signers/approvers/reviewers still pending), cancels scheduled email reminders, sends 'Signing Request Cancelled' email to active recipients, and writes a `document_voided` audit event. After void, every public access point for this document returns HTTP 410.\n\n**Request body** (all fields optional):\n- `reason`: string \u2014 included in cancellation email + audit log + voided banner.\n\n**Response (200 OK):**\n```\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"already_voided\": false,\n  \"document_id\": \"uuid\",\n  \"voided_at\": \"2026-02-04T11:00:35.377354+00:00\",\n  \"voided_by\": \"api_key:dfk_jAU6AGkv\",\n  \"void_reason\": \"...\",\n  \"cascaded_recipients\": 2\n}\n```\n\n**Notes:**\n- Idempotent \u2014 re-voiding returns the same void info with `already_voided=true`.\n- Allowed at any status (including completed/signed) per product spec.\n- Returns 404 if document doesn't belong to the API key tenant."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Void Package",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-API-Key",
                "value": "{{x_api_key}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"reason\": \"Contract terms changed \\u2014 package no longer needed.\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/docflow/public/packages/{{package_id}}/void",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "docflow",
                "public",
                "packages",
                "{{package_id}}",
                "void"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Void a package blueprint and cascade to ALL active runs, child documents, and active recipients. Cancels reminders, sends cancellation emails, writes a `package_voided` audit event.\n\n**Cascade scope:**\n- Blueprint package \u2192 status=voided\n- All non-terminal runs (in `docflow_packages` with _type='run' AND `docflow_package_runs`) \u2192 status=voided\n- All child documents tied to those runs \u2192 status=voided\n- All non-terminal recipients on each child document \u2192 status=voided\n\n**Response (200 OK):**\n```\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"already_voided\": false,\n  \"package_id\": \"uuid\",\n  \"voided_at\": \"2026-02-04T11:00:35.377354+00:00\",\n  \"voided_by\": \"api_key:dfk_jAU6AGkv\",\n  \"void_reason\": \"...\",\n  \"cascaded_documents\": 4,\n  \"cascaded_run_ids\": [\"pkg-blueprint-uuid\", \"run-uuid-1\", ...]\n}\n```\n\n**Notes:**\n- Idempotent \u2014 re-calling on already-voided package returns original void info.\n- Returns 404 if package not found or belongs to a different tenant.\n- After void, public package URL returns HTTP 410 with structured detail `{code:'package_voided', message, voided_at, void_reason, package_name}`."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
